  "historyNote": "#5289, eff 1-1-92, EXPIRED: 1-1-98 New. #8243, eff 12-31-04, EXPIRED: 12-31-12 New. #10322, INTERIM, eff 4-25-13, EXPIRED: 10-22-13 New. #10643, eff 7-18-14; ss by #14335, eff 8-2-25, EXPIRES: 8-2-35",
